------------------------------------------------------------
| Area        | Security Question                          |
------------------------------------------------------------
| Identity    | Who is the real user?                      |
| Delegation  | Is user identity preserved?                |
| Agent       | What permissions does it have?             |
| Tools       | Which tools can it invoke?                 |
| Parameters  | Are they validated and authorized?         |
| Resources   | Is object-level authorization enforced?    |
| Actions     | Which actions require approval?            |
| Chaining    | Can actions create dangerous sequences?    |
| Credentials | Are tools overprivileged?                  |
| Audit       | Can we trace user → agent → tool → action? |
------------------------------------------------------------
